B.a7q=s(["Lower the bar to the middle of your chest, elbows about 45 degrees from your sides.","Touch lightly, then press up and slightly back toward your face.","Keep your backside on the bench and your wrists over your elbows."],t.s)
B.a1Q=new A.bS("Chest, shoulders, triceps","Lie with your eyes under the bar, feet flat, shoulder blades pulled back and down. Grip a little wider than your shoulders.",B.a7q,"Bouncing the bar off your chest, or flaring the elbows straight out. Lift heavy sets with a spotter or inside a rack with safeties.")
B.aaP=s(["Lower the bar to your upper chest, just under the collarbones.","Press straight up until your arms are straight.","Keep your chest up the whole way."],t.s)
B.a2r=new A.bS("Upper chest, shoulders, triceps","Set the bench to about 30 degrees. Shoulder blades back, feet flat, grip a little wider than your shoulders.",B.aaP,"Setting the bench too steep: past about 45 degrees it becomes a shoulder press.")
B.a9q=s(["Press up until your arms are straight, dumbbells over your shoulders.","Lower slowly until your elbows are just below the bench (or your upper arms touch the floor).","Keep your shoulder blades pinned back."],t.s)
B.a2k=new A.bS("Chest, shoulders, triceps","Sit with the dumbbells on your thighs, lie back and bring them to your chest. On the floor, start with your upper arms resting down.",B.a9q,"Letting the dumbbells drift apart at the bottom faster than you can control.")
B.adv=s(["Press up and slightly in until your arms are straight.","Lower over two to three seconds to a deep stretch.","Keep your elbows under your wrists."],t.s)
B.a2q=new A.bS("Upper chest, shoulders","Bench at about 30 degrees. Dumbbells at your shoulders, palms forward.",B.adv,"Arching hard to turn it back into a flat press.")
B.a98=s(["Press out until your arms are nearly straight.","Come back slowly until you feel a stretch across the chest."],t.s)
B.a2c=new A.bS("Chest, shoulders, triceps","Set the seat so the handles line up with the middle of your chest. Back flat on the pad.",B.a98,"Letting the weight stack slam: keep tension at the bottom.")
B.ae6=s(["Sweep your hands together in front of your chest in a wide arc.","Squeeze for a moment, then open slowly to a stretch.","Keep the bend in your elbows the same throughout."],t.s)
B.a2n=new A.bS("Chest","Pulleys at about shoulder height. Step forward with one foot, a soft bend in the elbows.",B.ae6,"Bending and straightening the arms so it turns into a press.")
B.a8L=s(["Open your arms wide until you feel a stretch across the chest.","Bring them back together along the same arc."],t.s)
B.a2H=new A.bS("Chest","Lie back with the dumbbells above your chest, palms facing, elbows slightly bent. On the floor is fine: the floor limits the depth.",B.a8L,"Going heavy. This is a light, controlled movement; too deep with too much weight strains the shoulder.")
B.aaL=s(["Lower your chest to just above the floor, elbows about 45 degrees out.","Push the floor away until your arms are straight.","Squeeze your glutes so your hips don\u2019t sag."],t.s)
B.a2u=new A.bS("Chest, shoulders, triceps, core","Hands a little wider than your shoulders, body in one straight line from head to heels. Feet on a bench makes it harder.",B.aaL,"Hips sagging or head reaching for the floor. Too hard? Put your hands on a bench.")
B.a9N=s(["Lower until your upper arms are about level with the floor.","Press back up without locking out hard."],t.s)
