B.ae3=s(["Lower until your elbows are at about a right angle.","Press back up, keeping your back close to the bench."],t.s)
B.a2C=new A.bS("Triceps, shoulders","Hands on the edge of a bench behind you, fingers forward, legs out in front (bent knees is easier).",B.ae3,"Sinking too low or letting your shoulders roll forward.")
B.a5X=s(["Lower the top of your head toward the floor in front of your hands.","Press back up to straight arms."],t.s)
